step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple robust mean combination over the full model pool to see baseline performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full model pool to see if weighting improves over the plain mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination over the full model pool to see if it improves over the mean and weighted approaches.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Try a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming improves over plain mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the full pool to see if it beats the trimmed mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test the best single model ARIMA to see if a single model beats the trimmed mean on this series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on a smaller, trend‑focused pool (pool1) using inverse_error to see if focusing on top performers improves over best_single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle (w1) on the full pool to see if a meta-model weighting improves over plain mean or inverse error.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a slightly larger pool improves over pool1 results.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over a reduced, more stable pool (pool1) to see if restricting to top models improves performance over full pool mean and weighted combos.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a median combination on the larger pool2 to see if a robust central tendency helps when the pool contains more diverse models.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse_error on pool3 to see if a different subset improves over the current best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

